    "reviews": "\u201cAlthough Space Station Tycoon is still in Early Access, it\u2019s already incredibly enjoyable and definitely playable. Like any good tycoon game, there really isn\u2019t a limit to how big and badass you can get \u2014 not even the sky\u2019s the limit here, you\u2019re in it!\u201d<br>Hey Poor Player<br><br>\u201cFor a game built by a very small indie team, and this being their first title, it\u2019s already top shelf in my book \u2014 this is one to watch.\u201d<br>Gaming Trend<br>",
